  "05:11 — 城市开始变亮。": "05:11 — The city begins to brighten.",
  "雨把灯港区的招牌洗得很安静，只有市政厅那块仍在尽职撒谎：此处从无43号线。我沿票背的花粉绕到封闭维修站。出票机断电七年，色带却有余温；旧纸纤维记得伊芙琳失踪那年，新油墨只承认昨天。雾灯城擅长保存旧事，尤其是它已经盖章否认过的那些。": "The rain quietly washed the sign of the Port District, but only the city hall section still dutifully lied: there was never any Line 43 here. I followed the pollen on the back of the ticket to the closed repair station. The ticketing machine lost power for seven years, yet the ribbon still had warmth; Old paper fibers remember the year Evelyn disappeared, and new ink only acknowledges yesterday. Fog Light City excels at preserving old things, especially those it has already stamped and denied.",
