  "米娜没有回答关于伊芙琳的问题，只把夜香花往雨棚里挪了半步。花每四十三天出现，付款人没有名字，明信片没有地址——邮局大概会把这称为手续不全，雾灯城把它称为忠诚。米娜说从未见过伊芙琳，卡片却感谢她照看那些花。有些谎言不是墙，是替某个人虚掩着的门。": "Mina didn't answer Evelyn's question, only moving the night fragrance flower half a step into the rain shelter. Spend every forty-three days, payers have no names, postcards have no address—the post office would probably call this incomplete, and Fog Lights City call it loyalty. Mina says she has never seen Evelyn, but Card thanks her for taking care of the flowers. Some lies are not walls, but doors that are ajar for someone.",
