  "奥林把43号线从公开地图上刮掉，却把原图藏在第一个会被调查者打开的柜子里。这是档案员式的勇敢：把真相归进错误分类，再祈祷合适的人犯一次正确的错。玻璃丘寄存牌与照片箱号一致，温室下的铜扣属于一本账册。路线被藏起，是为阻止追捕；账册被藏起，是在等一位不会急着拥有它的读者。": "Orin scraped Line 43 off the public map but hid the original map in the first cabinet that would be opened by the investigator. This is the courage of an archivist: categorizing the truth into a misclassification, then praying that the right person makes the right mistake once. The Glass Hill deposit tag matches the box number in the photo, and the copper buckle under the greenhouse belongs to an account book. The route was hidden to prevent pursuit; The ledger is hidden in wait for a reader who won't be eager to own it.",
  "如果奥林想销毁证据，为什么把原始地图藏在最容易找到的柜子里？": "If Orin wanted to destroy the evidence, why hide the original map in the easiest cabinet to find?",
