  "宽叶上的铜绿脉络像一张被刮过的地图，透明孢囊则像没有标签的小抽屉，专门保存归错类的春天。": "The verdigris veins on the broad leaves resemble a scratched map, while the transparent sporangia resemble unlabeled little drawers, specially designed to preserve misclassified spring.",
