  "零点四十三分钟花": "Spent at 0:43",
  "只有附近所有钟表把谎说完，它才开花。钟表匠认为这是植物对行业规范缺乏尊重。": "Only when all the nearby clocks finish telling the lie does it bloom. Watchmakers believe this is a lack of respect for industry norms in plants.",
  "十二片烟蓝花瓣围住一枚琥珀信号芯，铃形果荚成熟时不会报时，只会提醒末班车仍愿意回来。": "Twelve smoky-blue petals surround an amber signal core. When the bell-shaped pods ripen, they don't chime the time, only reminding the last train to be willing to return.",
  "种核贴着旧信号线，等第一座钟沉默。": "The seed kernel was attached to the old signal line, waiting for the first clock to fall silent.",
