  "掌灯人不负责真相，只负责让每一扇坚持沉默的窗变得可以被数清。": "The lampbearer is not responsible for the truth, only to make every window that persistently silent can be counted.",
  "夜半的隐藏站台没有广播，所有停在不同时间的钟却同时让出一秒给00:43。": "The hidden platform at midnight had no broadcasts, but all the clocks stopped at different times simultaneously gave way to 00:43.",
  "候车长椅替账册保留了座位，旧闸机则把一句承诺当作有效车票。": "The waiting benches reserved seats for the ledger, while the old turnstiles treated a promise as a valid ticket.",
  "没有人承认列车会来，因此每个人都提前到了。真相也有自己的时刻表。": "No one acknowledged the train would come, so everyone arrived early. The truth also has its own timetable.",
  "末更的雾从隧道向外退，完整账册在黎明签收前仍保持一本私人信件的重量。": "The last shift of the mist recedes from the tunnel, and the complete ledger still weighs the weight of a private letter before dawn is signed.",
  "第一班清晨电车的司机看见旧信号亮起，选择把早到一分钟写成机械误差。": "The driver of the first early morning tram saw the old signal light up and chose to write 'one minute early' as a mechanical error.",
