  "白昼信号台只剩玻璃反光，隐藏站台却把入口藏进每个短暂闭眼的乘客影子里。": "During the day, only the glass reflected the signal tower, while the hidden platform concealed the entrance into the shadow of every passenger who briefly closed their eyes.",
