  "白天也有末班车，只是它从疲倦的人眼后经过。城市把这类路线归为休息，而不是失踪。": "There are last trains during the day, but they pass behind the eyes of tired people. The city classifies these routes as rest, not as disappearing.",
  "纸纤维里的第二场雨": "The second rain in paper fibers",
