  "最完整的虚拟样机，适合体验全部联动。": "The most complete virtual prototype, perfect for experiencing full integration.",
  "它把脉搏写成极细的金线，林渡只拿走摘要。": "It writes the pulse into extremely thin golden threads, and Lin Du only takes the summary.",
  "十七号夜表": "The night watch on the seventeenth",
  "用腕间动作与心率推断一夜的轮廓。": "Use wrist movements and heart rate to infer the outline of the night.",
  "表盘熄灭以后，秒针在城里继续走。": "After the dial went out, the second hand continued moving through the city.",
  "床下潮汐带": "Tidal bands beneath the bed",
  "无需穿戴，从压力与呼吸起伏读取安稳度。": "No need to wear it; stability is measured from pressure and breathing fluctuations.",
  "床垫下面有一条看不见的河，翻身就是潮汐。": "Under the mattress is an invisible river; turning over means the tide.",
