  "它不记梦，只记你把夜晚轻轻翻过了几次。": "It doesn't remember dreams, only that you gently turned the night over several times.",
  "计划通过 HealthKit 读取用户明确授权的睡眠摘要。": "Plans are underway to read users' explicitly authorized sleep summaries through HealthKit.",
  "计划通过 Health Connect 汇总兼容设备写入的睡眠记录。": "Plan to aggregate sleep records written by compatible devices via Health Connect.",
  "计划通过用户 OAuth 授权读取夜间汇总，不在客户端保存令牌。": "The plan is to authorize the user OAuth to read the nightly summary without storing tokens on the client.",
  "计划通过用户 OAuth 授权读取睡眠日志与夜间摘要。": "Plans to authorize users with OAuth to read sleep logs and night summaries.",
  "夜色很深，身体的信号却平稳。林渡把这份安静折进了归途。": "The night was deep, but my body's signals were steady. Lin Du folded this quiet into the journey home.",
  "一夜有轻微起伏，但节律完整；城市按约定交回了摘要。": "There are slight fluctuations throughout the night, but the rhythm remains intact; The city returned the summary as agreed.",
  "醒转把夜晚分成几段。调查没有失败，报告只是多了几道折痕。": "Wake up and turn the night into several segments. The investigation did not fail; the report only had a few more creases.",
